@CatalogApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7310

### Queries

GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?categoryId=1&onlyActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Commands

POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "code": "TEC-004",
  "name": "Auriculares bluetooth",
  "price": 45.00,
  "stock": 10
}

###

PUT {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Teclado mecánico RGB",
  "price": 64.90
}

###

PATCH {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": -3
}

### Validación: devuelve 400 con el detalle por campo

POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "code": "tec4",
  "name": "",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": -1
}

### Conflicto: devuelve 409 porque la categoría tiene productos

DELETE {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
